 drivers/cpufreq/cpufreq_hydrogenx.c            | 418 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 460 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/cpufreq/cpufreq_hydrogenx.c

